      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Hello 1.0.9</h2><ul><li>With the Dock and menu bar icons both off, ⌘Q now only closes the window. Hello keeps running in the background and your shortcut keeps working.</li>
<li>To quit Hello completely in that case, open it again and click Quit Hello on the General page.</li>
<li>Hello now shows up in the macOS Apps library.</li></ul>]]></description>
